  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Opening jam** (1 review): The opening jam was Pyramid Country, flowing into Train Train, and it returned later after Meet Me at the Creek [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Heart of Iron**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **I Dont want your opinon**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **LA Cowboy**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Muddy Water ease my Pain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Slip**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Who Shall Deliver**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Ive Been Hideing**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-06-02** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 95 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Encore was listed as Am I Born to Die [2]\n- An acoustic song, On the Line, was played out in the crowd and was not recorded [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-06-02**: transferred by Angelo Sixxo; source: akg.zoomf4.audacty [1]",
